{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"S1 PS4 green (LLM+1/Verified+1, CI 32087137633). Addressed PS4 advisory findings 1-2 (error-handling+performance, same site): relocated the _shadow() diagnostic call in _lib_ops.bridge_projects_set/remove to BEFORE the try/write_lock block (was inside both) so it neither extends the write-lock critical section nor risks misrouting into the op's except ValueError/KeyError handler. Behavior-preserving (shadow is read-only, non-raising). Finding 3 = recurring AC1 MCP/reconciler surface-parity test gap, already filed as bbb7. Oracle 39/39, lint+typecheck clean. Amending PS5."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787016687368520001,"uuid":"3ba887a2-1fa1-42e3-9f66-174d5fb8a14d"}